        "content": [
          "For J&J local contacts, the first step is to identify the business need.",
          "gather the business requirements",
          "create the RFP",
          "Once the RFP has been created, it should be submitted to vendors.",
          "The proposals received from the vendors should then be scored.",
          "a response should be requested from the vendors by a set date",
          "vendors should be downselected to present their proposals",
          "Once the proposals have been received, they should be scored again.",
          "presentations should be attended and the proposals should be rescored based on the Q&A sessions at the presentations.",
          "The updated proposals should then be reviewed and rescored based on the final proposals.",
          "the vendors should be notified of the selection",
          "A contract should be created based on the winning proposal, and this marks the end of the process."
        ]
      },
